            <td height="1052"> PMWATCH  - April 24, 2002 -- On April 12, 2002, PMWatch issued an alert against what we thought was
<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/cast/racistcartoon.asp">"the rawest display of racist yet".</a>  Little did we know that more
equally racist cartoons were forthcoming from other papers.
<p>
Here is yet another racist cartoon, published in the Palm Beach Post on Apr 23, by one Don Wright.  
The cartoon (see above) depicts four children expressing their mothers' hopes for them when they grow up.  
</p><p>
In our attempts to communicate with the paper, we have encountered from them nothing but arrogance and 
insensitivity of the worst kind.  Here is what a pmwatcher wrote us about an exchange he had with 
editorial page editor Randy Shultz:
</p><pre>	Randy Schultz, the editor of the Opinion section of the Palm Beach Post, completely supports 
	Don Wrights characterization of Palestinians. I just had a lengthy discussion with him.  Not 
	only did he tell me that I did not know what I was talking about because I apparently am not 
	qualified to speak out since I am neither Jewish nor Palestinian, but he also said that they 
	have numerous interviews with Palestinians who want their children to die as martyrs. So, he 
	concurs that ALL Palestinians want nothing more than to have their children kill Jews.  I 
	counterpointed him each time, but he continually retreated to saying that I was talking to 
	a wall because his mind was made up  they are not running a retraction and they stand by 
	Don Wrights political statement.

</pre>
<p>
Please give these heedless, careless, "journalists" a call and share with them your feelings
about not only the cartoon but their insensitivity.


	Don Wright: Editorial cartoonist - (561) 820-4118
	randy_schultz: Editorial page editor - (561) 820-4447
	Sharon Falso: Asst Ed page ed - (561) 820-4461

Please also send a note demanding an immediate, public apology for this despicable cartoon 
(slide below for input interface).

Fill your contact info and your letter and click send.  It will be sent to:

</p><pre>		don_wright@pbpost.com
		letters@pbpost.com
		randy_schultz@pbpost.com
		sharon_falso@pbpost.com
</pre>
<p>
Previous action call against cartoonist Mike Smith: <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/cast/racistcartoon.asp">racistcartoon.asp</a>
</p><p>
For a previous example of what we can do when we mobilize against a racist cartoon, please visit:
<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/cartoons/edmonton.html">http://www.pmwatch.org/pmw/cartoons/edmonton.html</a>
</p><p>
You can also shame this cartoonist to his peers by going to:
<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/topeers/cartoonists.asp">
http://www.pmwatch.org/pmw/TOPEERS/CARTOONISTS.ASP?TYPE=TBLCARTOONISTS</a>
</p><p>
Palestine Media Watch
</p><p>
<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/index.html" class="dead" aria-disabled="true">http://www.pmwatch.org</a>

            </p></td>
